    {
      "source": "The resulting <code>typeRef</code> instance can then be used to obtain a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Type.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Type</code></a>\ninstance that carries the captured parameterized type information at runtime.\nFor more information on \"super type tokens\" see the link to Neal Gafter's blog post.",
      "translation": "生成的 `<code>typeRef</code>` 实例可用于在运行时获取携带捕获的参数化类型信息的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Type.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Type</code></a> 实例。有关“超类型令牌”的更多信息，请参阅 Neal Gafter 博客文章的链接。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Build a <code>ParameterizedTypeReference</code> wrapping the given type.",
      "translation": "构建一个包装给定类型的<code>ParameterizedTypeReference</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<ul class=\"tag-list-long\">\n<li><a href=\"https://gafter.blogspot.nl/2006/12/super-type-tokens.html\">Neal Gafter on Super Type Tokens</a></li>\n</ul>",
      "translation": "<ul class=\"tag-list-long\">\n<li><a href=\"https://gafter.blogspot.nl/2006/12/super-type-tokens.html\">Neal Gafter 关于超级类型标记</a></li>\n</ul>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>type</code> - a generic type (possibly obtained via reflection,\nfor example, from <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html#getGenericReturnType()\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Method.getGenericReturnType()</code></a>)",
      "translation": "<code>type</code> - 一种泛型类型（可能通过反射获得，例如从 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html#getGenericReturnType()\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Method.getGenericReturnType()</code></a>）",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<span id=\"type-param-T\"><code>T</code> - the referenced type</span>",
      "translation": "<span id=\"type-param-T\"><code>T</code> - 引用的类型</span>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "a corresponding reference which may be passed into\n<code>ParameterizedTypeReference</code>-accepting methods",
      "translation": "一个对应的引用，可传入接受`ParameterizedTypeReference`的方法中。",
      "count": 2
    },
